WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.620
Someone you love is grieving,

2
00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:06.780
and you’re afraid you’ll say the wrong

3
00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:07.240
thing.

4
00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:09.880
Romans twelve tells us to weep

5
00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:11.000
with those who weep.

6
00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:14.420
Genuine love makes room for another person’s

7
00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:14.840
sorrow.

8
00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:17.340
You don’t need an explanation that makes

9
00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:18.580
their pain make sense.

10
00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:20.880
You can begin by being there

11
00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:21.640
and listening.

12
00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:24.060
Let them speak about the person they

13
00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:24.400
miss.

14
00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:27.020
Let a quiet moment stay quiet.

15
00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:29.320
Their tears don’t need to make you

16
00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:29.600
leave.

17
00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:30.940
You might say,

18
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:32.460
I’m so sorry.

19
00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:34.000
Would you like some company?

20
00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:36.220
Then listen to what they need.

21
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:38.580
Christ has brought us into a life

22
00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:39.120
of love.

23
00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:42.000
Sometimes that love looks like staying beside

24
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.360
someone whose sorrow you can’t take away.
